@startuml render-order
' One render pass. Every step is idempotent: it compares with the live DOM
' or with the last HTML it set, and reports whether anything changed.
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #DDEBF7
  BorderColor #52687A
  ArrowColor #52687A
  FontColor #182734
}
title render(): the order of one pass and why

start
:Set the fitter's scale from the viewport,
because widths are quantized to device pixels; <<#EDEDED>>
:Drop the status message if it has expired; <<#EDEDED>>
:<b>render_visibility</b>
Show or hide the sidebar. Hide the panel for the Wallet
<i>before</i> any panel HTML is set, so no gap opens above the form.
Show the wallet form and the find box (.off) as needed; <<#E2EFDA>>
:<b>render_toolbar_state</b>
Rail .on, the sidebar toggle pressed, Back and Forward disabled; <<#DDEBF7>>
:<b>render_address</b>
Restore the page address unless the user is typing.
The focus ring, and the ghost hints from the raw field text;
if (a field asked to be selected by Ctrl+L, Esc or Ctrl+F\nand it still has the focus?) then (yes)
  :select its whole text, caret at the start; <<#FFF2CC>>
endif
:<b>render_tab_strip</b>
strip_layout, then the fitted titles; <<#DDEBF7>>
:<b>render_suggestions</b>
The badge, identity or magnifier, and the dropdown; <<#DDEBF7>>
:<b>render_prompt</b>
The active tab's first question, with "1 of N"; <<#FCE4D6>>
:<b>render_sidebar</b>
Header and count, constant controls, chips, the panel; <<#E2EFDA>>
:<b>render_find</b>
The box's count and ghost hint, and the hit overlay; <<#FFF2CC>>
:<b>render_status</b>
Stage chip, reason or notice, budget, message; <<#EDEDED>>
:Window title: the page title, then " — F1R3Gaze"; <<#EDEDED>>
stop
@enduml
